      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMCyhbGo4ggM",
      "content": "I would say damage the items is more concerning just because that my move shouldn't take too much time. So I'm not that worried about if they're a little bit late but my last move my sub was damage and it wasn't with you all it was someone else, I can't even remember so yeah, I would say that's the main concern.",
