      "time": "2026-10-15T15:53:53.360400",
      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "Awesome and then we do have our no worries damage coverage. So we treat your furniture like it's our own everything gets padded before at leas the room and not just your furniture, your floors and walls, and doorways too on the way out, and on the way in, on the rare occasion something does get damaged or no worries. Damage coverage kicks in, automatically up to $2,000 per move included at no extra cost. No deductible, no find print and built right into your hourly rate and then we resolve claims in four to six days on average if something were to happen.",
